# Connection instance names

A variable, field, or parameter that holds a connection is named `connection`. The name says what the value is.

```csharp
// ❌ BAD
var owned = DefaultConnection();
await owned.Open();

// ✅ GOOD
var connection = DefaultConnection();
await connection.Open();
```

```typescript
// ❌ BAD
const owned = this.defaultConnection();

// ✅ GOOD
const connection = this.defaultConnection();
```

```rust
// ❌ BAD
let owned = self.default_connection();

// ✅ GOOD
let connection = self.default_connection();
```
